      },
      "finalScene": [
        {
          "lineId": "again",
          "text": "I was hoping you would say that. I liked being close to you before. I want this time too.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "room_end",
          "text": "When she is ready to go, she picks up her bag. I walk her to my door. We say goodbye there, with another outing still ahead of us.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "history",
          "text": "So do I. Which one are you thinking of? I am hoping it is something we were terrible at.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "sketch"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "dance"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "private"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "company"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "history",
          "text": "Én is. Mire gondolsz? Remélem, valamire, amiben borzalmasak voltunk.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "sketch"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "dance"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "private"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "company"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "sketch_memory",
          "text": "Drawing with you. We both carried on after the first terrible line. I would like more of that.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "sketch_reply",
          "text": "I nearly brought a ruler. Imagine how much worse it could have been. Next time, you choose what we draw. I want to see what catches your eye.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "room",
          "text": "We pack both cups and the flask, then walk back through the park. About seventeen minutes later I unlock my suite. She puts her bag beside the spare chair.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "intimacy",
          "text": "I want to stay with you. More than a kiss, if you want that too.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "again"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "stop"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "intimacy",
          "text": "Veled szeretnék maradni. Többre vágyom egy csóknál, ha te is.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "again"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "stop"
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineId": "again",
          "text": "Reméltem, hogy ezt mondod. Jó volt veled korábban. Most is szeretném.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "continue"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
